es, but storage costs about 490 for item 0 plus about 130 for item 1. Batches of item 0 that must cover three days within its 4-day shelf life also make spoilage more likely. Overall it comes out about −150 against the daily plans. The 172-unit capacity limit isn't hit.\n\nCandidate 1's lead is small, around 50–60 out of a total in the hundreds, but I'm reasonably confident it's the best choice."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 356, "cache_read_input_tokens": 5792, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 356}, "output_tokens": 5, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-14T12:14:18.297Z", "request_id": "req_011Cg27MEbR17QP1TskM4gp6"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01PeQrN7r2isme9EiRVWPfu3", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011Cg27MEuH2ALeqTPw25CDr", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01PeQrN7r2isme9EiRVWPfu3", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"choice": 1}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 356, "cache_read_input_tokens": 5792, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 356}, "output_tokens": 5, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, 